<title>USA: NetVantage names Cairns interim CFO.</title>
<headline>NetVantage names Cairns interim CFO.</headline>
<dateline>EL SEGUNDO, Calif. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>NetVantage Inc said Monday it named Dion Cairns interim chief financial officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>NetVantage announced last Friday that Thomas Baker had resigned the position.  Cairns will hold the post until a permanent successor is found.</p>
</text>
